1
00:00:03,574 --> 00:00:05,874
你怎么不說話 生我氣了嗎
Why aren't you talking, are you mad at me?

2
00:00:05,964 --> 00:00:08,104
不 我是被發現自己懷孕這件事嚇到了
No! I'm freaked because I just found out that I'm pregnant.

3
00:00:08,104 --> 00:00:09,864
不過我確實有點生你的氣
And yes, I am a little mad at you,

4
00:00:09,864 --> 00:00:11,134
因為這事很嚴肅
because this is serious,

5
00:00:11,134 --> 00:00:12,524
但你唯一能想到的卻是
and the only thing that you can think about

6
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:14,904
把我們的名字組合成完美的寶寶名字
is combining our names into the perfect baby name.

7
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:17,244
至少現在知道寶寶不是叫海登就是叫迪莉
Well, now we know it's either Hayden or Dyley.

8
00:00:17,904 --> 00:00:20,114
這是件美好的事情
Look, this is a beautiful thing.

9
00:00:20,164 --> 00:00:21,465
我們愛的結晶
A product of our love.

10
00:00:21,684 --> 00:00:23,724
是"我們"的愛的結晶吧
It is a product of our love, right?

11
00:00:23,724 --> 00:00:25,324
是的 迪蘭 我算過了
Yes, Dylan. I did the math.

12
00:00:25,324 --> 00:00:26,364
上次你算數的時候
Last time you did the math

13
00:00:26,364 --> 00:00:28,643
我們不小心留下了300美元的小費
we accidentally left a $300 tip.

14
00:00:28,643 --> 00:00:30,184
我不知道該怎么辦
Oh, I don't know what to do.

15
00:00:30,393 --> 00:00:31,454
這樣如何
How about this?

16
00:00:32,933 --> 00:00:34,693
海莉·格溫多林·鄧菲
Haley Gwendolyn Dunphy...

17
00:00:34,803 --> 00:00:35,944
你愿意嫁給我嗎
will you marry me?

18
00:00:36,053 --> 00:00:37,693
你現在是在開玩笑嗎
Are you kidding me right now?

19
00:00:37,693 --> 00:00:39,293
想象一下我們一起走過紅毯的畫面
Picture us walking down the aisle,

20
00:00:39,293 --> 00:00:41,693
一位妙人身穿著純白無暇的禮服
a breathtaking vision in virginal white

21
00:00:41,703 --> 00:00:43,163
而你穿著自己想穿的衣服
and you wearing whatever you want.

22
00:00:43,163 --> 00:00:44,384
我不要嫁給你
I'm not marrying you!

23
00:00:44,413 --> 00:00:46,893
好吧 好吧 我們慢慢來
Okay, okay, one step at a time.

24
00:00:46,953 --> 00:00:49,793
我們先給你補充維生素 打造健康飲食
We'll put you on vitamins and a healthy diet.

25
00:00:49,823 --> 00:00:51,284
你現在是一人吃給寶寶補了
You'll be eating for one now.

26
00:00:52,783 --> 00:00:54,264
好極了 是棒棒糖
Score! Lollipops!

27
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:55,383
我該怎么和我媽媽說
How am I gonna tell my mom?

28
00:00:55,383 --> 00:00:56,943
她一直不讓我做的就是這件事
This is the one thing she always told me not to do,

29
00:00:56,943 --> 00:00:58,633
而你就是那個她說不要一起做的人
and you're the person she told me not to do it with.

30
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:00,353
是啊 她說得真是準
Yeah, she really nailed that one.

31
00:01:00,483 --> 00:01:02,253
希望咱們的寶寶能有她的聰明才智
I hope our baby gets her brain.

32
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:03,843
你為什么一點都不害怕
Why aren't you freaking out?

33
00:01:03,933 --> 00:01:05,623
因為這是好事啊
Because this is a good thing,

34
00:01:06,743 --> 00:01:07,513
難道不是嗎
isn't it?

35
00:01:07,513 --> 00:01:08,444
我...
I...

36
00:01:08,943 --> 00:01:09,954
我不知道
I don't know.

37
00:01:11,333 --> 00:01:13,003
天哪 我得去上班了
Oh, my God, I have to get to work.

38
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:14,493
我喜歡那工作 但我甚至都不知道
To a job that I love, which I don't even know

39
00:01:14,493 --> 00:01:15,684
它允不允許帶孕上班
if I can do with a baby!

40
00:01:15,843 --> 00:01:16,944
只是 我
Just -- I, um...

41
00:01:17,283 --> 00:01:18,524
我需要點空間
I need some space.

42
00:01:20,803 --> 00:01:22,843
13美元 3進位...
$13, carry the 3...

43
00:01:22,843 --> 00:01:23,834
留50美元小費吧
Leave a $50.

44
00:01:37,143 --> 00:01:37,823
很好 湯普森
All right, Thompson,

45
00:01:37,823 --> 00:01:40,353
干凈利落點 平托斯基 沖啊
run a crisp route! Pitkowski, go!

46
00:01:41,043 --> 00:01:42,114
看看這群人
Look at them out there.

47
00:01:42,283 --> 00:01:44,233
他們一團糟 注意力不集中
They are a mess. No focus!

48
00:01:44,233 --> 00:01:45,903
你告訴過他們不要吃雞肉了 對吧
You told them about not eating chicken, right?

49
00:01:45,903 --> 00:01:46,883
那小鳥容易緊張不安
It's a nervous bird.

50
00:01:46,883 --> 00:01:48,853
比賽之前 應該吃點平和的哺乳動物
Before the game, you eat your calm mammals,

51
00:01:48,853 --> 00:01:50,103
牛肉啊 羊肉啊之類的
your beefs, your muttons.

52
00:01:50,103 --> 00:01:51,243
好了 大家過來這邊
Okay, guys, get in here!

53
00:01:51,243 --> 00:01:52,454
我們走 集中起來
Let's go. Huddle up!

54
00:01:52,643 --> 00:01:54,783
我們即將參加城市冠軍賽
We're about to play for the city championship,

55
00:01:54,783 --> 00:01:56,803
杰一直在幫忙
and Jay here has been helping out.

56
00:01:56,803 --> 00:01:58,223
我當團隊鼓舞員的角色有很多年了
I've been a team booster for years.

57
00:01:58,223 --> 00:02:00,003
一般來說這意味著
Usually that means cutting a check

58
00:02:00,003 --> 00:02:02,413
由普里契特關懷基金開張支票
from the Pritchett Cares Foundation.

59
00:02:02,483 --> 00:02:04,064
我們支持運動員
We support athletics

60
00:02:04,113 --> 00:02:07,862
以及對問題少年們進行衣柜職業教育
and we educate at-risk youth about careers in closets.

61
00:02:07,882 --> 00:02:09,252
這是一條真正的出路
It's a real path out.

62
00:02:09,532 --> 00:02:11,422
好了 今天是你們生命中最重要的一天
Okay, this is the biggest day of your lives

63
00:02:11,422 --> 00:02:15,052
但你們看起來就像是一群小女孩
and you're looking like a bunch of little girls out there!

64
00:02:15,312 --> 00:02:18,007
怎么 平托斯基 芭比娃娃忘帶了嗎
What's wrong, Pitkowski, did you forget your Barbies?!

65
00:02:18,007 --> 00:02:21,372
教練 我們一直在討論
Coach, we've been talking,

66
00:02:21,902 --> 00:02:23,202
你最近說的話
and the language you've been using lately

67
00:02:23,202 --> 00:02:24,643
感覺很傷人
feels, well, hurtful.

68
00:02:25,042 --> 00:02:26,173
還有些性別歧視
And sexist.

69
00:02:26,182 --> 00:02:27,703
還有一點性別簡化
And a little gender reductive.

70
00:02:28,042 --> 00:02:29,122
這究竟是怎么回事
What the hell is happening?

71
00:02:29,122 --> 00:02:30,172
我們只是希望你能
We'd just like you to consider

72
00:02:30,172 --> 00:02:32,072
考慮一下用鼓勵代替辱罵的方式
adopting a more empowering style.

73
00:02:32,922 --> 00:02:34,113
你知道嗎
Okay, you know what?

74
00:02:34,572 --> 00:02:36,482
這是橄欖球
This is football!

75
00:02:36,732 --> 00:02:39,262
怎么 你們的訓練胸罩太緊了嗎
What's wrong, are your training bras too tight?!

76
00:02:39,262 --> 00:02:40,603
塔克教練
Coach Tucker!

77
00:02:40,792 --> 00:02:43,432
請立刻到我辦公室見我
Please see me in my office now!

78
00:02:43,802 --> 00:02:45,322
不 親愛的 我不想去機場
No, honey, I don't want to pick your sister up

79
00:02:45,322 --> 00:02:46,242
接你妹妹
at the airport!

80
00:02:46,242 --> 00:02:48,632
抱歉 我在跟我女朋友說話
Oh, sorry, I'm talking to my girlfriend

81
00:02:48,632 --> 00:02:51,502
碰巧還一直按著喇叭開關
and I accidentally kept the megaphone button pressed!

82
00:02:51,922 --> 00:02:53,112
她最近一直纏著我
She's really been riding me lately,

83
00:02:53,112 --> 00:02:53,852
我跟你們講
let me tell you!

84
00:02:53,852 --> 00:02:54,742
不 親愛的 不
Oh, no sweetheart, no,

85
00:02:54,742 --> 00:02:56,132
我不是故意讓你聽到這些的
I didn't mean for you to hear that!

86
00:02:56,202 --> 00:02:59,052
不 不 你是我的一切 毋庸置疑
No, no, no, you're my everything! Of course!

87
00:03:07,692 --> 00:03:09,042
我給我和米奇爾搞到了
I got tickets for me and Mitchell

88
00:03:09,042 --> 00:03:10,532
在棕櫚泉觀看
to a screening in Palm Springs

89
00:03:10,532 --> 00:03:12,432
《星球大戰之帝國反擊戰》放映會的門票
of "The Empire Strikes Back" --

90
00:03:12,432 --> 00:03:14,462
還有由大明星喬治·盧卡斯
Q&A to follow with the biggest star of all --

91
00:03:14,462 --> 00:03:15,493
主持的問答會
George Lucas.

92
00:03:15,792 --> 00:03:17,672
我特別興奮 因為我有點把米奇
I'm super stoked because I kind of think of Mitch

93
00:03:17,672 --> 00:03:19,153
當成我從未有過的弟弟了
as the brother I never had.

94
00:03:19,722 --> 00:03:21,652
我想不通我們為何不多花點時間待在一起
I don't know why we don't spend more time alone together.

95
00:03:21,652 --> 00:03:22,872
這不是任何人的錯 除了
It's nobody's fault. Except for --

96
00:03:22,872 --> 00:03:24,242
小卡和克萊爾
for Cam and Claire.

97
00:03:24,712 --> 00:03:26,912
你知道嗎 我現在特別高興
You know, I'm as happy now as I've ever been.

98
00:03:26,912 --> 00:03:28,052
看啊 我們在尤凱帕
And look, we're in Yucaipa.

99
00:03:28,052 --> 00:03:29,692
這聽起來像星戰里伊沃克人說的話
That sounds like how Ewoks talk.

100
00:03:29,692 --> 00:03:32,562
我出柜前常溜到尤凱帕的一家同性戀酒吧
I used to sneak off to a gay bar in Yucaipa before I came out.

101
00:03:32,562 --> 00:03:34,922
通常還以為小鎮不會有同性戀酒吧呢
Huh, you don't really think of gay bars as a small-town thing.

102
00:03:34,922 --> 00:03:35,702
有的
Oh, yeah.

103
00:03:35,702 --> 00:03:37,252
不管是鄉村來的同性戀
They serve your rural gays,

104
00:03:37,252 --> 00:03:39,292
沒出柜的同性戀 還是城里來的新手
your closeted gays, your city newbies

105
00:03:39,292 --> 00:03:41,282
都可以去那里適應自己的同性戀生活
looking to get their gay sea-legs,

106
00:03:41,402 --> 00:03:44,202
有點像是去百老匯之前的外地試演
kind of like an out-of-town tryout before they hit Broadway.

107
00:03:44,292 --> 00:03:46,562
看吧 每次和你一起我都能學到新東西
See, I learn something whenever I spend time with you.

108
00:03:46,562 --> 00:03:48,382
還記得你告訴我不要在跳舞時打響指嗎
Remember when you told me not to snap when I dance?

109
00:03:48,382 --> 00:03:49,451
你當時看起來像想弄掉
It looked like you were trying to get peanut butter

110
00:03:49,451 --> 00:03:50,602
手指沾到的花生醬
off your fingers.

111
00:03:51,611 --> 00:03:53,112
說到這個 我餓了
Speaking of which, I'm starving.

112
00:03:53,501 --> 00:03:55,621
其實那家酒吧有很棒的漢堡包
That bar actually has amazing hamburgers

113
00:03:55,621 --> 00:03:56,731
你想停下來吃個午飯嗎
if you want to stop for lunch?

114
00:03:56,731 --> 00:03:57,852
我可以進去嗎
Am I allowed in?

115
00:03:58,131 --> 00:03:58,911
誰會知道呢
Who's gonna know?

116
00:03:58,911 --> 00:04:00,412
別打響指就不會有人知道
Just don't snap.

117
00:04:02,551 --> 00:04:04,181
你覺得我能搞定這件衣服嗎
Do you think I could rock this?

118
00:04:04,391 --> 00:04:05,881
"搞定"這詞沒過時吧
Do people still say rock?

119
00:04:05,881 --> 00:04:07,331
每當你問我年輕人會怎么說的時候
It makes me sad when you have to ask me

120
00:04:07,331 --> 00:04:08,961
我都感覺很難過
what young people say.

121
00:04:08,991 --> 00:04:10,581
艾麗克斯 歌洛莉亞
Alex? Gloria? Ahh!

122
00:04:10,951 --> 00:04:12,002
嗨 嗨
Hmm. Hi. Um, hi!

123
00:04:12,171 --> 00:04:13,581
你在這兒干嘛呢
What are you doing here?

124
00:04:13,721 --> 00:04:15,161
我需要點性感的衣服
I needed some sexy clothes,

125
00:04:15,161 --> 00:04:17,111
所以我就請歌洛莉亞陪我逛街了
so I asked Gloria to help me shop.

126
00:04:17,441 --> 00:04:18,511
無意冒犯我媽
No offense to my mom,

127
00:04:18,511 --> 00:04:20,611
但是她穿得有點保守
but she dresses kind of conservative

128
00:04:20,611 --> 00:04:22,231
而歌洛莉亞知道如何挑選
while Gloria knows how to pick out clothes

129
00:04:22,231 --> 00:04:23,102
能幫我
that will help...

130
00:04:23,321 --> 00:04:25,921
展示一下這寶貝的衣服
take this baby for a spin.

131
00:04:26,111 --> 00:04:27,071
得了 艾麗克斯
Alex, come on,

132
00:04:27,071 --> 00:04:28,971
想那么說起碼自己得相信啊
sell it if you're gonna talk like that.

133
00:04:29,131 --> 00:04:30,481
剛好路過補鞋店
Just stopped by the cobbler

134
00:04:30,481 --> 00:04:32,931
給我的樂福鞋換個鞋底
to get my penny loafers re-soled.

135
00:04:33,281 --> 00:04:35,521
穿了三十年的那雙
Same pair for 30 years.

136
00:04:35,701 --> 00:04:36,581
你們在這兒干什么
What are you guys doing?

137
00:04:36,581 --> 00:04:38,021
我們就是 不 我們
Oh, we're just -- Uh, no, we, uh,

138
00:04:38,021 --> 00:04:40,271
在分別購物 好玩的是
were shopping separately, funniest thing,

139
00:04:40,271 --> 00:04:42,711
我們就突然遇到了對方
and we just bumped into each other!

140
00:04:42,711 --> 00:04:43,632
是吧
Right?

141
00:04:44,321 --> 00:04:46,381
是啊 真是有趣
Yes, it was hilarious.

142
00:04:46,381 --> 00:04:49,601
我在逛街 然后就 就像她說的那樣
I was shopping, and -- and then all she said.

143
00:04:51,331 --> 00:04:52,171
那么你買了什么
So, what did you buy?

144
00:04:52,171 --> 00:04:53,581
不 不 不 這不是我買的
Oh, no, no, no. It's -- It's not mine.

145
00:04:53,581 --> 00:04:55,791
是她的 你能自己拿一會兒嗎
It's hers. Could you hold it for a minute?

146
00:04:55,791 --> 00:04:57,372
我胳膊都酸了
My arms are tired!

147
00:04:58,071 --> 00:04:59,871
她可是示巴女王
This one, the Queen of Sheba.

148
00:04:59,871 --> 00:05:01,281
我們都得服侍著她
We all work for her.

149
00:05:02,581 --> 00:05:03,642
我們玩得很高興
We have fun.

150
00:05:06,961 --> 00:05:07,901
漢堡包很好吃
Burger's amazing.

151
00:05:07,901 --> 00:05:09,082
這地方很不錯
This place is great.

152
00:05:09,641 --> 00:05:11,161
這些小鎮上同性戀們真的厲害
These small town gays have it made.

153
00:05:11,161 --> 00:05:13,011
是啊 雖然他們只能躲在暗處
Yeah, I mean, they're forced to live in the shadows,

154
00:05:13,011 --> 00:05:15,371
但他們能吃到薯條 所以...
but they do get to eat fries, so...

155
00:05:15,461 --> 00:05:16,442
我的天哪
Oh, my God!

156
00:05:16,821 --> 00:05:17,942
那不是格爾·索普嗎
Is that Gil Thorpe?

157
00:05:17,961 --> 00:05:19,481
同性戀們并不全都互相認識 菲爾
We don't all know each other, Phil.

158
00:05:19,481 --> 00:05:20,331
還留著胡子
With the beard.

159
00:05:20,331 --> 00:05:21,421
這里又沒有女人
There are no women in here.

160
00:05:21,421 --> 00:05:23,131
就在那兒 他是我的死敵
Right there, he's my nemesis.

161
00:05:23,131 --> 00:05:24,821
他怎么可能在這里呢
What could he possibly be doing here?

162
00:05:25,561 --> 00:05:27,191
我可能知道哦
I might have a theory.

163
00:05:27,461 --> 00:05:28,612
真不敢相信
Oh, my God!

164
00:05:29,011 --> 00:05:30,710
他在假裝自己是同性戀
He's pretending to be gay.

165
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,070
你在耍什么把戲 格爾
What is your game, Gil?

166
00:05:37,910 --> 00:05:39,110
妮可快來了嗎
is Nicole coming in soon?

167
00:05:39,110 --> 00:05:40,660
她的音浴進行得有點晚
Her sound bath ran late.

168
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:41,970
有什么特殊活動嗎
Is there a special occasion?

169
00:05:41,970 --> 00:05:43,021
為什么會有特大潛艇堡
Why the party sub?

170
00:05:43,290 --> 00:05:45,170
這是普通大小的潛艇堡啊
this is a normal sandwich.

171
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,351
你好 海莉
Hello, Haley.

172
00:05:48,590 --> 00:05:50,170
這兒怎么有個這么大的潛艇堡
Why the enormous sandwich?

173
00:05:50,170 --> 00:05:52,230
這是很普通的... 算了
This is an ordinary... doesn't matter.

174
00:05:52,230 --> 00:05:53,520
妮可 我們能聊聊嗎
Nicole, can I have a minute?

